WEBVTT

00:25.880 --> 00:27.880
Would

00:25.880 --> 00:27.880
it really

00:26.460 --> 00:27.880
be

00:26.960 --> 00:27.880
okay to

00:27.460 --> 00:27.880
accept...

00:28.200 --> 00:31.390
Would it really be okay to accept
his burning manhood?

00:31.390 --> 00:35.380
Before she could reach an answer,
her body grew moist...

00:35.380 --> 00:36.640
That's no good.

00:37.220 --> 00:38.930
N-No good?

00:40.460 --> 00:43.310
Is this the end for the Newspaper Circle?

00:43.310 --> 00:46.190
<i>Is my writing really that bad?</i>

00:47.470 --> 00:49.610
Circulation's dropped drastically?

00:49.610 --> 00:51.180
No.

00:51.180 --> 00:53.110
Th-Then the school isn't letting us publish?

00:53.120 --> 00:57.110
Even I thought that last article
was kind of pushing it...

00:57.110 --> 00:59.110
That's not it.

00:59.110 --> 01:03.240
If the Newspaper Circle's done for,
I'll have nothing left to live for.

01:03.240 --> 01:05.620
I'll have to disappear.

01:18.380 --> 01:19.620
What was that?

01:20.670 --> 01:24.350
Who knows? The chief's full of mysteries.

01:24.350 --> 01:29.100
Now that I think of it, I don't know
anything about the chief.

01:29.110 --> 01:31.900
My heart throbs as I really do love you!

01:40.450 --> 01:45.290
These fifteen secrets in my head are written in letters, tucked away in my uniform.

01:45.290 --> 01:51.090
When you keep on making circles around me, in the middle of the launch of your image,

01:51.920 --> 01:56.630
you treat me kindly even with your mean look and puffed cheeks.

01:56.630 --> 02:02.310
For your first heart-throbbing, I'm sure you'll find it tremendous!

02:02.850 --> 02:05.770
Your voice will escape daringly!

02:05.770 --> 02:08.640
What you want to make your heart tingle, tell me!

02:08.640 --> 02:11.560
Quick! Let me! Where do you want what?! Seriously, you're terrible!

02:11.560 --> 02:13.570
These wild ideas have all detonated!

02:13.570 --> 02:16.400
I want to try and swallow more

02:16.400 --> 02:19.570
I want you to pet me more

02:19.570 --> 02:22.410
What kind of flavor is your heart?

02:22.410 --> 02:25.290
Someday, I'll be sure to grasp a hold of what's real

02:25.290 --> 02:27.580
I want to embrace you more

02:27.580 --> 02:30.790
Will you secretly let me see you?

02:30.830 --> 02:33.670
I can't get enough of this dream I'm having!

02:33.670 --> 02:39.050
Be it my heart or also my body, I'll hand them over since it's you.

02:36.880 --> 02:41.640
My heart throbs as I really do love you! (Look here!)

02:42.510 --> 02:47.810
My heart throbs as I really do love you!

02:59.530 --> 03:03.530
"Director of X-Files"

03:01.640 --> 03:03.700
Please, Ran...

03:04.770 --> 03:07.460
Just her name or address.

03:07.460 --> 03:09.870
Go ask the chief yourself.

03:09.870 --> 03:12.380
If she'd tell me, I wouldn't have to ask you.

03:13.910 --> 03:16.630
Ah, well. I guess I do owe you one.

03:17.960 --> 03:21.070
You want me to search the
academy database, right?

03:17.960 --> 03:23.090
Search

03:17.960 --> 03:23.180
Newspaper Circle Chief

03:23.260 --> 03:23.970
No data found matching your request.

03:23.970 --> 03:27.060
I guess we need her name...

03:27.060 --> 03:29.980
Or we could simply search for her by picture.

03:32.390 --> 03:35.580
This is the facial recognition system
used by the FBI.

03:35.580 --> 03:40.540
I'll find any photos of her,
in or out of the school.

03:40.540 --> 03:43.250
Wow, I didn't know you could do that.

03:44.490 --> 03:47.120
Oh? You think some firewall will stop me?

03:48.370 --> 03:51.350
You're really well protected, aren't you?

03:51.350 --> 03:55.250
Too bad! You can't hide anything from me.

03:55.250 --> 03:56.750
R-Ran!

03:56.750 --> 04:01.720
How naughty you are. Show me everything,
and I'll make you feel better!

04:01.720 --> 04:05.090
That's right... You're my slave now.

04:05.090 --> 04:07.720
Call me Onee-sama!

04:12.230 --> 04:14.450
You did it! Way to go, Ran!

04:14.450 --> 04:18.460
That's strange... This graduation
photo is two years old.

04:18.460 --> 04:19.920
Two years old?

04:20.650 --> 04:24.030
This class trip took place twenty years ago.

04:24.590 --> 04:26.570
Wh-What does it mean?

04:30.240 --> 04:31.660
This is over a hundred years old.

04:31.660 --> 04:34.920
I've got photos of her from every era.

04:34.920 --> 04:38.170
Who is the chief, really?

04:38.170 --> 04:42.720
It's kind of creepy. Wouldn't it be best
not to get more deeply involved?

04:42.720 --> 04:45.050
<i>I don't have a choice.</i>

04:45.050 --> 04:48.680
<i>It's going to bug me so much,
I won't be able to write!</i>

04:56.170 --> 04:59.060
<i>I will solve this mystery!</i>

05:12.080 --> 05:14.580
She disappeared? No way!

05:16.080 --> 05:18.830
Is she a ghost?!

05:33.740 --> 05:38.100
In this form, I can't satisfy you, can I?

05:38.720 --> 05:42.040
You still have those wonderful breasts.

05:42.040 --> 05:43.530
They're more than enough.

05:50.440 --> 05:51.830
That's disgusting.

05:53.950 --> 05:56.970
There are things in this world

05:56.970 --> 06:00.050
that must remain un— No!

06:00.050 --> 06:01.670
Disgusting!

06:01.670 --> 06:03.670
It was just a gust of wind...

06:16.310 --> 06:19.520
Oh, it's you, Taketo. Don't scare me like that.

06:20.900 --> 06:22.190
She has legs.

06:22.190 --> 06:26.730
I'm glad to see you taking an
interest in your work, but...

06:34.510 --> 06:37.050
What the hell were you thinking?

06:38.000 --> 06:40.430
The chief is a ghost? Are you an idiot?

06:40.430 --> 06:42.880
Have your blue balls finally driven you crazy?

06:43.360 --> 06:45.350
It's possible, right?

06:45.350 --> 06:47.920
There are pictures of ghosts.

06:47.920 --> 06:50.510
Th-Those are just photographic errors.

06:50.510 --> 06:51.760
But...

06:51.760 --> 06:54.760
I said it's impossible! Totally impossible!

06:56.230 --> 06:59.130
Might you be scared of ghosts?

06:59.130 --> 07:01.620
Th-That's not true!

07:01.620 --> 07:03.390
Then help me.

07:03.390 --> 07:05.270
I-I refuse!

07:05.900 --> 07:09.900
Only ugly photographs interest me.

07:10.740 --> 07:12.530
I guess she really is frightened.

07:18.510 --> 07:22.420
<i>It doesn't matter. If I keep
following her, eventually...</i>

07:26.920 --> 07:29.550
Oh, fine.

07:31.040 --> 07:35.050
Knock a home run out of the park!

07:43.560 --> 07:47.670
Too bad, stranded on base. Don't mind, girl!

07:47.670 --> 07:49.820
How long will she be in there?

07:51.000 --> 07:55.130
<i>I haven't taken my eyes off the entrance,
so I'm sure she's still inside.</i>

07:55.820 --> 07:58.400
<i>Is she sick? Or...</i>

07:58.400 --> 07:59.950
What are you doing?

07:59.950 --> 08:01.840
U-Utae-san!

08:02.480 --> 08:03.580
Peeking?

08:03.580 --> 08:05.290
N-N-N-No!

08:05.290 --> 08:07.570
I'm just kidding... I know that's not it.

08:09.620 --> 08:11.080
Hey, Utae-san.

08:11.670 --> 08:14.340
Could you see if the chief's in there?

08:14.340 --> 08:16.380
Sure, I guess.

08:16.380 --> 08:20.760
Chief, you in there?
Newspaper Circle Chief-san?

08:20.760 --> 08:22.910
<i>That ought to do it.</i>

08:22.910 --> 08:24.850
Looks like she isn't in there.

08:24.850 --> 08:26.940
N-No way!

08:31.440 --> 08:35.570
Chief! You're in there, right? Come out!

08:38.740 --> 08:41.000
They came out...

08:41.900 --> 08:45.000
L-Little delinquent!

08:48.890 --> 08:51.420
That really is a strange story.

08:51.420 --> 08:54.340
I can't believe she just disappeared.

08:54.340 --> 08:58.470
That toilet's on the 4th floor, so she
couldn't have used the window.

08:58.470 --> 09:00.300
It doesn't make sense...

09:02.140 --> 09:04.760
Maybe I should just give up...

09:04.760 --> 09:08.340
I'm not a detective. I'm just a porno author.

09:08.340 --> 09:10.460
Maybe I'm not cut out for this.

09:11.770 --> 09:13.400
I'll help you!

09:14.400 --> 09:16.860
In mysteries, all great detectives
have a partner, right?

09:16.860 --> 09:19.410
Let's solve the mystery together, Holmes!

09:20.780 --> 09:22.160
Utae-san...

09:22.160 --> 09:25.400
This time, it's my turn to help you.

09:30.290 --> 09:32.420
I don't see anything strange.

09:32.420 --> 09:34.470
B-Be careful.

09:34.470 --> 09:35.920
It's fine.

09:35.920 --> 09:37.670
If anything happens, let me know immediately.

09:41.930 --> 09:44.930
Sorry. You can't see at all from there, can you?

09:44.930 --> 09:47.610
No, I can see just fine...

09:47.610 --> 09:49.640
No! It's nothing!

09:55.820 --> 09:57.700
T-Taketo-kun, are you okay?

09:57.700 --> 09:59.240
I think I'm dying...

09:59.240 --> 10:01.200
I'm so happy, I'm dying...

10:12.170 --> 10:15.820
If we find her house, I'm sure
we'll solve the mystery.

10:16.370 --> 10:18.660
But aren't these outfits a bit much?

10:18.660 --> 10:21.260
I've worn outfits like this on TV.

10:21.260 --> 10:23.170
They really make you feel
like a detective, right?

10:23.170 --> 10:25.420
You're totally into this, aren't you, Utae-san?

10:25.420 --> 10:27.470
Huh? Well...

10:27.470 --> 10:29.810
C-Come on! We have to follow her.

10:43.240 --> 10:45.050
What is she doing?

10:48.030 --> 10:49.130
Oh, no!

10:49.130 --> 10:50.120
Utae-san!

10:50.120 --> 10:53.830
We'll pretend we're boyfriend and girlfriend.
It happens all the time in movies, right?

10:59.590 --> 11:02.170
I said we were pretending.

11:02.170 --> 11:04.650
Of course. We're pretending to be in love.

11:04.650 --> 11:05.760
No!

11:06.850 --> 11:08.060
Not in public...

11:08.060 --> 11:10.130
If you struggle, she'll notice us.

11:10.130 --> 11:13.060
We're lovers right now, aren't we?

11:13.060 --> 11:14.570
You're so mean...

11:15.770 --> 11:16.570
Taketo-kun!

11:17.400 --> 11:19.360
The chief disappeared!

11:19.360 --> 11:21.070
She was just there a second ago!

11:21.570 --> 11:23.320
We only looked away for a second.

11:23.320 --> 11:28.260
L-Let's look for her! I'll take the main building.
You check the girl's dorms.

11:35.210 --> 11:36.600
N-Narukara-san...

11:36.600 --> 11:38.080
G-Good evening.

11:38.080 --> 11:41.210
Th-Thanks for earlier. Heading home?

11:41.210 --> 11:42.440
Y-Yeah!

11:55.270 --> 11:56.770
U-Uh, bye...

11:56.770 --> 11:58.270
U-Um...

11:59.900 --> 12:01.530
S-Sorry!

12:02.030 --> 12:03.490
How's it going there?

12:04.190 --> 12:06.450
She isn't there? I don't see her, either.

12:07.950 --> 12:10.310
Fine. I'll come and meet you right now.

12:10.330 --> 12:12.370
Sorry, what were you saying?

12:12.370 --> 12:14.250
No, it was nothing.

12:34.270 --> 12:37.820
We lost her today, but let's try again tomorrow.

12:39.190 --> 12:40.780
Yeah. That's right.

12:40.780 --> 12:45.570
No, I've never talked to a boy like this before.

12:46.200 --> 12:48.780
I guess it makes me kind of nervous...

12:48.780 --> 12:50.350
I like it.

13:02.460 --> 13:04.290
A mystery circle?

13:08.010 --> 13:13.520
That's where she was yesterday,
when she lifted her arms up to the sky.

13:13.520 --> 13:15.810
The chief's involved somehow?

13:15.810 --> 13:17.930
Do you think she's an alien?

13:17.930 --> 13:19.060
No way.

13:19.060 --> 13:21.050
It's a real possibility.

13:21.980 --> 13:26.030
I searched for records related to
those photographs of the chief.

13:26.530 --> 13:31.290
UFOs were spotted in the same locations,
about 40% of the time.

13:31.290 --> 13:33.250
Then the chief is...

13:34.200 --> 13:36.250
The chief is an alien.

13:38.290 --> 13:40.880
But it's only 40%, right?

13:40.880 --> 13:42.880
That's a pretty high probability.

13:43.670 --> 13:44.880
Ritsu...

13:44.880 --> 13:50.640
If two records match with that probability,
it's no coincidence.

13:52.340 --> 13:55.600
Looks like you're sneaking around
for some reason.

13:55.600 --> 13:56.930
Just the two of you...

13:56.930 --> 13:58.430
Y-You've got it all wrong!

13:58.430 --> 14:01.260
She's just helping me. Right?

14:01.260 --> 14:02.520
Y-Yeah.

14:02.520 --> 14:04.510
Forget that! What about the chief?

14:04.510 --> 14:07.820
We're in big trouble if aliens
are infiltrating the school.

14:07.820 --> 14:09.780
But aliens? Seriously?

14:09.780 --> 14:13.200
Some mathematical equations prove the
existence of extraterrestrial life.

14:13.200 --> 14:15.040
According to Drake's equation...

14:15.040 --> 14:17.120
H-Hey, we can't come to that conclusion yet.

14:17.120 --> 14:19.200
We aren't sure about this!

14:19.200 --> 14:21.500
C-Come?

14:22.960 --> 14:25.260
T-Taketo...

14:25.260 --> 14:27.270
Th-The formula, Ritsu!

14:27.270 --> 14:29.990
3.14159...

14:29.990 --> 14:31.590
So, what do we do?

14:31.590 --> 14:33.760
We have to find evidence...

14:33.760 --> 14:36.840
Something that proves she's an alien!

14:39.070 --> 14:41.610
I see. I understand.

14:41.610 --> 14:45.980
If the chief's an alien, why would
she come to this school?

14:45.980 --> 14:47.150
Why?

14:55.950 --> 14:59.330
The Earthlings' energy, overflowing with life...

14:59.330 --> 15:00.830
It's all mine.

15:04.000 --> 15:05.840
<i>Her tongue's going so deep...</i>

15:08.550 --> 15:12.590
Please take it all!

15:12.590 --> 15:14.240
It might be worth it...

15:14.240 --> 15:15.850
Nothing!

15:15.850 --> 15:19.560
I'll log into CIA and former-KGB databases

15:19.560 --> 15:21.940
for all the information I need!

15:21.940 --> 15:24.270
N-No way! How?

15:24.770 --> 15:28.780
And then it went boom! Then ka-boom!
And then kra-koom!

15:29.610 --> 15:32.780
This is Snake. SitRep. Over.

15:32.780 --> 15:37.160
All green. The chief hasn't
noticed anything. Over.

15:37.160 --> 15:39.210
Good. Let's get a little closer.

15:46.170 --> 15:50.550
U-Um, did you need something?
Yeah, I guess so...

15:52.550 --> 15:53.680
Run!

16:01.970 --> 16:03.560
They're going to catch us!

16:03.560 --> 16:05.940
I'll protect Taketo!

16:19.280 --> 16:20.870
We're safe...

16:21.450 --> 16:24.080
I'm sorry this happened to you.

16:24.080 --> 16:25.750
No, I'm fine.

16:25.750 --> 16:28.590
Detectives get in this kind of
trouble all the time, right?

16:28.580 --> 16:29.750
But...

16:31.090 --> 16:34.620
Come on, partner. Keep your spirits up!

16:35.760 --> 16:40.600
I'm really happy to be able to
help you out like this, Taketo-kun.

16:42.100 --> 16:44.100
So, no apologies.

16:46.270 --> 16:47.610
Utae-san...

16:47.610 --> 16:51.900
I couldn't get any data...
Someone messed with the power!

16:51.900 --> 16:53.110
Someone?

16:53.110 --> 16:54.990
It has to be the chief's men!

16:54.990 --> 16:57.150
Does that mean she doesn't
want us to investigate?

16:57.150 --> 16:59.720
Most likely. I think we should stop.

16:59.720 --> 17:00.570
But...

17:00.570 --> 17:04.610
You could end up in even more
danger next time, Utae-chan!

17:04.610 --> 17:06.830
You shouldn't get involved in stuff like this!

17:11.000 --> 17:13.510
Is that so? Understood.

17:16.130 --> 17:18.600
Ran might be right.

17:18.600 --> 17:19.720
Taketo-kun...

17:21.340 --> 17:23.180
This is it then?

17:23.890 --> 17:27.930
Hey, why do you want to know
the chief's true identity?

17:29.140 --> 17:30.550
Well, you know...

17:30.550 --> 17:33.790
There's a trust between a writer and an editor.

17:33.790 --> 17:37.010
I think you shouldn't have any doubts
about the person you're working with.

17:38.390 --> 17:39.410
I guess that's why.

17:40.150 --> 17:41.990
Then you mustn't give up!

17:42.990 --> 17:47.120
To write good novels, you need her. Right?
So you can't give up!

17:47.120 --> 17:48.210
Utae-san...

17:48.210 --> 17:49.790
Let's both do our best, okay?

17:50.330 --> 17:51.920
Then may I ask you something?

17:51.920 --> 17:54.420
Why are you doing all this for me?

17:54.420 --> 17:55.970
W-Well...

17:55.960 --> 17:59.220
I think that I...

18:00.090 --> 18:02.510
I think maybe it's because I like you!

18:02.510 --> 18:06.100
I'm a fan of Akutagawa Taketo, the author.

18:24.010 --> 18:26.060
What is she doing here?

18:26.060 --> 18:28.920
This isn't somewhere she has any reason to be.

18:28.920 --> 18:32.670
Maybe there's a secret UFO base here.

18:32.670 --> 18:34.450
In the school?

18:35.170 --> 18:36.930
But this building...

18:35.170 --> 18:37.670
Music Room 3

18:36.930 --> 18:38.710
Taketo-kun, the chief...

18:38.710 --> 18:39.930
No!

18:40.580 --> 18:42.340
We only took our eyes off of her for a second.

18:43.330 --> 18:45.430
She must've gone inside.

18:52.430 --> 18:54.570
N-Narukara-san?

18:54.570 --> 18:56.800
Akutagawa-kun! You came to see me!

18:56.800 --> 18:57.970
Taketo-kun?

19:01.130 --> 19:02.320
Fukune-san?

19:09.580 --> 19:12.060
The chief isn't here, is she?

19:12.060 --> 19:12.890
No.

19:12.890 --> 19:15.680
Narukara-san, sorry to interrupt your practice.

19:20.230 --> 19:21.410
Fine...

19:30.940 --> 19:33.610
Isn't that the loading dock where they
bring in teaching supplies?

19:33.610 --> 19:35.630
Yeah, I think so.

19:37.360 --> 19:38.280
What do we do?

19:38.280 --> 19:39.210
Let's go.

19:43.190 --> 19:44.430
It's cold...

19:44.430 --> 19:45.860
What is this place?

19:53.340 --> 19:54.880
A freezer?!

19:54.890 --> 19:56.690
O-Oh, no!

19:56.690 --> 19:58.400
I-It's not opening...

19:59.130 --> 20:00.590
No...

20:00.590 --> 20:02.130
How did this happen?

20:04.970 --> 20:07.010
Th-The chief isn't here.

20:08.520 --> 20:10.980
Damn it... I have to do something!

20:17.420 --> 20:19.720
If there's an air duct somewhere...

20:22.330 --> 20:23.490
I see light!

20:31.170 --> 20:32.310
What is this?

20:36.290 --> 20:37.750
Utae-san!

20:38.240 --> 20:39.070
I'm so sleepy...

20:39.070 --> 20:41.290
Y-You can't fall asleep here!

20:41.290 --> 20:43.420
I'm fine...

20:43.420 --> 20:47.460
<i>What should I do? I never thought we
could freeze to death at school.</i>

20:47.460 --> 20:50.010
<i>I must ensure that Utae-san survives at least.</i>

20:50.010 --> 20:52.770
There's one thing they always do
when stranded on a mountain.

21:00.030 --> 21:03.050
Strip and keep each other warm.

21:03.050 --> 21:04.530
It's the only way.

21:05.760 --> 21:08.030
No, no! This isn't the time for that...

21:08.030 --> 21:10.190
Wake up, Utae-san!

21:10.190 --> 21:13.520
There's something I'd like
to say, no matter what.

21:13.520 --> 21:15.240
If this is the end...

21:15.240 --> 21:17.610
Don't say this is the end!

21:18.460 --> 21:22.550
If I fall asleep now, I know I'd regret it.

21:25.790 --> 21:27.780
You see, I...

21:31.100 --> 21:34.060
I... Taketo-kun, I...

21:45.390 --> 21:46.760
Utae-san?

21:47.400 --> 21:49.490
Taketo-kun...

21:49.490 --> 21:50.780
<i>Good...</i>

21:50.780 --> 21:53.290
You were about to freeze to death.

21:53.880 --> 21:55.670
You saved us, chief?

21:55.670 --> 21:56.790
Yes.

21:56.790 --> 21:59.290
Th-Thank you.

21:59.290 --> 22:03.050
There are some things in this world
you should leave alone.

22:04.300 --> 22:09.390
Oh, right. The Newspaper Circle will
continue to function normally.

22:09.390 --> 22:12.060
I'm counting on you for more articles.

22:12.060 --> 22:14.180
Wait, chief!

22:14.840 --> 22:18.810
I'm not the one you should be learning about.

22:28.630 --> 22:30.010
Why?

22:33.820 --> 22:36.730
Hey there, that FLASHY POWER needs more energy!

22:36.730 --> 22:39.770
Shout HURRAY, and raise the words of PEACE to the sky!

22:51.300 --> 22:54.220
